    document["paths"]["/api/v2/migu/resources/process"] = nlohmann::json::parse(R"transferjson({"post":{"tags":["migu"],"summary":"Accept independent resources transfers","description":"Accepts explicit file resource IDs (not song/catalog IDs or arbitrary paths). At most 200 resources and 600 target tasks. Empty destinations resolve from enabled startup configuration. Requires parallel mode and migration admission. HTTP 202 is durable acceptance, not completed content. Artifacts must already have controlled readable producer input; missing input remains waiting_input. Existing idempotency keys return the first operation without changing targets, adapter or verification policy. Maintenance permits replay of an existing matching idempotency key; fresh keys remain unavailable. Internal producer parent fields are never accepted over HTTP.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V2ResourcesProcess"}}}},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Durably accepted operation.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V2TransferOperation"}}}},"200":{"description":"Idempotent replay.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V2TransferOperation"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid or unknown fields; no operation accepted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}},"409":{"description":"Idempotency or version conflict.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}},"500":{"description":"Persistence failed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}},"503":{"description":"Mode, target, schema or maintenance unavailable; an uncertain commit must be reconciled with the same idempotency key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}}}}})transferjson");
